      "title": "bib-photo-ingestion-watcher",
      "description": "Integration-watcher for bib physical-review issues. When a page photo is uploaded to a `bib-physical-review` issue (or an in-repo source passage is agent-identified), OCR/read it, formalise the cited result in Lean (per-paper package, wrapper-for-overlap), confirm the QOU usage matches the source, run machine + agent bib validation, then set the reference status to `validated` and refresh the reference's human-review record. Use when processing a bib-physical-review issue that has an attached photo, or when ingesting an uploaded paper.",
